    "body": "The library doesn't return the correct width for some multi-codepoint emojis.\r\n\r\n`wcwidth('🤦🏼‍♂️')` returns `5`, but it should return `2`.\r\n\r\nSee also: https://github.com/jquast/wcwidth/issues/39",
